    <description>Created by: Elevation Solutions


After-save record-triggered flow on Individual Application. When integrated priority flags are stamped (Employee Priority, Sibling Attending Priority, Sibling Applying Priority), the flow creates related Priority Item records (one per type) and maps integrated detail fields from the Individual Application. Includes duplicate-prevention by checking for existing Priority Items by Individual Application + Priority Type.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Individual Application (After Save) Create Priority Items (Integrated) {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Individual Application (After Save) Create Priority Items (Integrated)</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
